 ## 6. Known gaps and follow-ups
 
-(filled in at the end)
+- **Meta on the Razr cover screen's map:** V-44's line "9 postings list no place, so not on the map" (bottom left, 90%
+  opaque, no taps) lies over Meta's two pins and the foot of the Pay | Juice box on the 123 px map. A fit can't leave
+  room for it at the world view; counting it as a control only merged the pins under it. It needs a call on that line at
+  that size (hide it there like the offline note, or a shorter wording); its words are not this lane's.
+- **The cover screen's chart at the peek** keeps its caption and part of its scale (34–37 px) so that the first card's
+  title and pay show (B-12). The peek is the sheet's lowest state, so there the chart is a glance at its scale (it held
+  half a row before); ux-density-6's spec allows 0 rows on the cover screen.
+- **Phase 2 (ux-density-6's spec, D-1 to D-14)** comes next: the measured peek without the Juice line from half up, the
+  compact chart rows, the median once, the tagline on the first visit only, the one-row top bar from 640 px, the
+  phone-sizes.mjs patch.
+- `node scripts/refresh/registry.js --lines --write` was not run here (map.js and app.js lines moved; the lead runs it at
+  integration, and many of its references had already moved).
+- WebKit: not installed here; webkit-phone.yml runs phone-smoke and the matrix in WebKit.
 
